WEBVTT

00:00:07.952 --> 00:00:09.992
-Hello?
-Elastigirl's in trouble.

00:00:10.152 --> 00:00:11.472
What? What happened to her?

00:00:11.632 --> 00:00:12.992
Sorry to tell you
on the phone.

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:14.672
Meet me on our ship
at DEVTECH.

00:00:14.872 --> 00:00:16.952
The ship at DEVTECH.
I'll be there in 15 minutes.

00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:19.072
VIOLET: What's at the ship
at DEVTECH?

00:00:19.232 --> 00:00:20.872
Lucius? Bob.
Helen's in trouble.

00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:22.432
I need someone
to watch the kids.

00:00:22.592 --> 00:00:23.992
Suit up. It might get weird.

00:00:24.152 --> 00:00:25.872
I'll be there.
ASAP. Fifteen tops.

00:00:26.032 --> 00:00:27.712
HONEY: Where are you
going ASAP?

00:00:27.792 --> 00:00:29.312
You better be back ASAP!

00:00:29.512 --> 00:00:30.712
And leaving that suit.

00:00:30.872 --> 00:00:32.352
I gotta go.
I'll be home soon.

00:00:32.552 --> 00:00:33.752
Lucius will be here sooner.

00:00:33.832 --> 00:00:35.912
No firing the baby
around the house, okay?

00:00:36.072 --> 00:00:37.792
What's at the ship at DEVTECH?

00:00:37.872 --> 00:00:39.952
And why are you
in your Supersuit?

00:00:41.592 --> 00:00:42.992
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:00:46.592 --> 00:00:47.632
(GASPS)

00:00:52.232 --> 00:00:53.712
Is that Mom's supersuit?

00:00:53.912 --> 00:00:55.512
She may need it.
You never know.

00:00:55.672 --> 00:00:57.312
What's going on?

00:00:57.472 --> 00:00:59.352
I don't know,
but Dad called Lucius

00:00:59.432 --> 00:01:01.312
after getting a call
about Mom...

00:01:01.472 --> 00:01:02.592
and then left.

00:01:02.792 --> 00:01:04.352
I thought you renounced
superheroes.

00:01:04.512 --> 00:01:07.432
Yeah, well,
I renounce my renunciation.

00:01:07.592 --> 00:01:08.792
Put that on.

00:01:10.672 --> 00:01:11.872
(DOORBELL RINGS)

00:01:19.992 --> 00:01:22.432
Hello there, little fella.

00:01:22.592 --> 00:01:24.112
Hello.

00:01:24.312 --> 00:01:25.432
You kids aren't safe.

00:01:25.512 --> 00:01:26.712
The Deavors sent us
to take you...

00:01:26.872 --> 00:01:29.632
FROZONE: Well,
isn't that redundant?

00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:32.512
The Deavors just sent me here
to guard the house.

00:01:34.952 --> 00:01:37.552
'Cause the kids aren't safe.

00:01:37.712 --> 00:01:39.592
I get it, managerial screw-up.

00:01:39.752 --> 00:01:42.512
Tell Winston I handled it.
You understand, Ms...

00:01:42.672 --> 00:01:43.952
Voyd.

00:01:44.112 --> 00:01:45.552
Ms. Voyd.

00:01:46.832 --> 00:01:47.792
Drive safely.

00:01:49.072 --> 00:01:50.072
(BEEPS)

00:01:50.472 --> 00:01:51.592
(BOTH GASP)

00:01:57.712 --> 00:02:01.392
The thing is, he wants us
to bring you, too.

00:02:01.552 --> 00:02:02.592
Hey.

00:02:02.712 --> 00:02:04.232
(ALL GRUNT)

00:02:04.352 --> 00:02:05.712
That isn't gonna
hold them long.

00:02:06.832 --> 00:02:08.432
Dash, grab the baby!

00:02:08.512 --> 00:02:09.712
(ALL STRAINING)

00:02:09.792 --> 00:02:10.992
(VIOLET SCREAMS)

00:02:11.272 --> 00:02:12.272
Spread out!

00:02:14.712 --> 00:02:15.712
-Whoa!
-FROZONE: Oh!

00:02:16.392 --> 00:02:17.832
-(GRUNTS)
-Dash!

00:02:18.312 --> 00:02:19.672
We gotta get to my car.

00:02:22.232 --> 00:02:23.392
(ROARS)

00:02:29.112 --> 00:02:31.072
What? What's going on?

00:02:31.232 --> 00:02:32.312
Little fella!

00:02:33.192 --> 00:02:34.392
(SCREECHING)

00:02:40.512 --> 00:02:41.912
(STRAINING)

00:02:41.992 --> 00:02:43.112
-(GROWLS)
-(GASPS)

00:02:45.032 --> 00:02:46.232
(GROANING)

00:02:47.192 --> 00:02:48.952
(VIOLET SCREAMING)

00:02:49.352 --> 00:02:50.432
(GRUNTS)

00:02:50.992 --> 00:02:52.152
It worked!

00:02:52.712 --> 00:02:53.752
(FROZONE GRUNTING)

00:02:58.312 --> 00:02:59.912
Incredibile, windows down!

00:03:01.672 --> 00:03:02.672
Dive in!

00:03:07.912 --> 00:03:09.352
-(CHUCKLES)
-(GRUNTS)

00:03:09.472 --> 00:03:11.912
Incredibile,
set voice identification.

00:03:11.992 --> 00:03:13.312
Loudly, say your names.

00:03:13.472 --> 00:03:16.152
-Violet Parr.
-Dashiell Robert Parr.

00:03:16.672 --> 00:03:17.912
(GRUNTING)

00:03:19.112 --> 00:03:20.512
(GROANS)

00:03:20.632 --> 00:03:21.632
Lucius!

00:03:21.952 --> 00:03:23.792
-(YELLS)
-Incredibile, escape!

00:03:32.152 --> 00:03:33.472
Fill me in!

00:03:33.632 --> 00:03:35.312
Good news and bad news.
We found her.

00:03:35.472 --> 00:03:36.712
She seems physically fine

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:38.392
but she's had an encounter
with Screenslaver...

00:03:38.552 --> 00:03:40.792
and she's acting
kind of strange. In here.

00:03:44.632 --> 00:03:45.712
Strange how?

00:03:45.832 --> 00:03:47.312
(GROANING)

00:03:54.192 --> 00:03:55.192
Helen? (GROANS)

00:03:56.152 --> 00:03:57.712
Helen, what are you...

00:03:58.872 --> 00:03:59.912
(CHOKING)

00:04:06.432 --> 00:04:07.672
Helen, it's me.

00:04:07.992 --> 00:04:09.032
(GASPS)

00:04:14.672 --> 00:04:15.992
(GROANING)

00:04:18.112 --> 00:04:19.152
(EXHALES)

00:04:24.752 --> 00:04:26.632
Incredibile, pull over.

00:04:31.352 --> 00:04:34.352
(SIGHS) We can't go to E's.

00:04:34.512 --> 00:04:36.672
You saw those goggles
they put on Lucius.

00:04:36.832 --> 00:04:38.632
They were wearing them, too.

00:04:38.792 --> 00:04:41.352
They're all under
someone's control.

00:04:41.552 --> 00:04:44.072
They've probably done
the same to Mom.

00:04:45.552 --> 00:04:47.632
Okay. Bad guys after us.

00:04:47.792 --> 00:04:49.352
No Mom, no Dad.

00:04:49.512 --> 00:04:50.632
No Lucius.

00:04:50.792 --> 00:04:54.312
But we have our powers,
this car...

00:04:55.352 --> 00:04:58.792
and... what?

00:04:58.872 --> 00:05:01.032
-(JACK-JACK COOING)
-(RUMBLING)

00:05:02.752 --> 00:05:03.912
(BOTH GASPING)

00:05:10.992 --> 00:05:13.552
Incredibile,
take us to DEVTECH.

00:05:17.072 --> 00:05:19.312
The kids have escaped
in a tricked-out car,

00:05:19.392 --> 00:05:20.752
but we got Frozone.

00:05:20.912 --> 00:05:23.712
Bring him to the ship
at DEVTECH immediately.

00:05:29.192 --> 00:05:31.192
Aw, we missed 'em!

00:05:31.632 --> 00:05:35.752
Oh, I wish the Incredibile
could follow that boat.

00:05:38.552 --> 00:05:40.232
-What did you do?
-I don't know.

00:05:40.392 --> 00:05:42.952
-What did you do?
-I didn't do anything!

00:05:43.072 --> 00:05:44.352
(DASH SCREAMING)

00:05:50.712 --> 00:05:53.832
Wow, this car does
anything I say.

00:06:01.512 --> 00:06:03.272
We didn't plan this well.

00:06:03.432 --> 00:06:04.752
What do you mean?
We're here, aren't we?

00:06:04.912 --> 00:06:06.352
Yes, we're here.

00:06:06.552 --> 00:06:08.912
We need to be up there.

00:06:09.872 --> 00:06:11.192
Hey...

00:06:11.392 --> 00:06:14.832
What if the Incredibile
has ejector seats?

00:06:15.592 --> 00:06:16.952
VIOLET: Wait, what? No.

00:06:17.192 --> 00:06:18.592
-Yeah, baby!
-No, don't say any more...

00:06:18.752 --> 00:06:20.072
Max power! Launch!

00:06:20.272 --> 00:06:21.472
(BOTH SCREAM)

00:06:25.872 --> 00:06:27.552
(JACK-JACK LAUGHING)

00:06:27.672 --> 00:06:28.992
Come on.

00:06:29.632 --> 00:06:31.312
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:06:32.232 --> 00:06:33.752
Hello!
Glad you could come.

00:06:33.952 --> 00:06:35.632
Welcome to the conference.

00:06:42.712 --> 00:06:44.112
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:06:46.192 --> 00:06:47.912
Our stars, where are they?

00:06:48.112 --> 00:06:49.352
The event's about to start.

00:06:49.552 --> 00:06:51.232
They didn't want to upstage
the others.

00:06:51.432 --> 00:06:53.112
They'll join for the signing.

00:06:53.872 --> 00:06:56.432
Welcome, guests!
You're in for a treat.

00:06:56.632 --> 00:07:00.912
This ship is the largest
hydrofoil on the planet.

00:07:01.112 --> 00:07:02.152
So, hold onto something...

00:07:02.312 --> 00:07:04.712
because we're going
to open her up!

00:07:11.392 --> 00:07:12.512
(ALL GASPING)

00:07:20.632 --> 00:07:22.632
(ALL EXCLAIMING)

00:07:23.272 --> 00:07:25.592
We need to find Mom and Dad.
Stay here.

00:07:25.752 --> 00:07:26.752
I'm gonna search for them.

00:07:26.872 --> 00:07:29.312
Wait! Who's gonna
watch Jack-Jack?

00:07:29.512 --> 00:07:31.352
Suck it up. I won't be long.

00:07:31.552 --> 00:07:34.072
Wait. Wait, but, but wait!

00:07:34.232 --> 00:07:36.792
This is important.
They are in trouble.

00:07:36.952 --> 00:07:39.672
It's up to us.
To us, understand?

00:07:39.832 --> 00:07:42.472
Keep him amused but quiet!

00:07:43.752 --> 00:07:44.792
Ugh.

00:07:54.752 --> 00:07:56.552
-(CRYING)
-Shh! Quiet!

00:07:57.672 --> 00:07:58.712
Huh?

00:08:01.672 --> 00:08:02.912
(LAUGHING)

00:08:03.032 --> 00:08:04.032
Jack-Jack?

00:08:05.752 --> 00:08:06.752
(VIOLET GRUNTS)

00:08:14.032 --> 00:08:15.872
Jack-Jack?
Jack-Jack!

00:08:20.112 --> 00:08:21.112
(GASPS)

00:08:22.072 --> 00:08:23.072
(YELPS)

00:08:24.392 --> 00:08:26.232
(VIOLET GRUNTING)

